---
args: {"candidate": "PayableCase", "prior": "LiabilityVersion[]", "documents": "EvidencePage[]"}
returns: "LiabilityVersion"
---
Compare explicit correction, supersession, cancellation and supplier references across documents. Separate a replacement invoice from a new service obligation; retain both versions of a replacement but one liability. Verify the issuer and applicable entity. Record the actual active version and linked credit IDs from sources. Missing or conflicting supersession cannot be resolved by the larger amount or later upload alone.
